  "details": "I think VRChat could definitely do with a system to choose between different moods and settings in different spaces. There's an inherent divide between people that want to be calm and talk to people, and the people that want to be loud around loud people. A little preference setting that someone could set could go a long way. Perhaps some sort of integration into joining a world. So you can make a pretty good guess as to what it'll be like could go a long way",
